{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, take it, check its properties, and perform specific task. Move and scan otherwise. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
